## Suggested Itinerary (≈ 8–10 hrs)

| Time | Activity | Notes |
|------|----------|-------|
| **08:30** | Brandenburg Gate | Arrive early for fewer crowds; snap photos. |
| **09:15** | Walk to Reichstag (≈ 10 min) | Book dome online in advance. |
| **10:30** | Reichstag dome & Parliament Square | Explore the dome, take panoramic photos. |
| **11:30** | Walk to Holocaust Memorial (≈ 15 min) | Reflective walk, then head to Museum Island. |
| **12:15** | Lunch on Museum Island | Café am Bode or nearby bistro. |
| **13:00** | Museum Island tour | Pick 2–3 museums (Pergamon & Neues are must‑sees). |
| **15:30** | Berlin Cathedral | Climb dome, visit interior. |
| **16:30** | Optional: Checkpoint Charlie & Gendarmenmarkt | 30‑min stroll, coffee break. |
| **17:30** | End of day | Enjoy a coffee or early dinner in the area. |

